	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0203_poke4_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンは　いわかべを　かけあがり
ほらあなの　どこかへ　きえてしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:49:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:49:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンは　岩壁を　駆け上がり
洞穴の　どこかへ　消えてしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:49:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:49:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・ポケモンを倒した場合</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:49:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE4
ポケモン・コバルオン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:49:26" />
		</AttributeCell>
